WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.113 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 6=

01:38.600 --> 01:39.680
I'm just gonna lie back down.

01:47.600 --> 01:49.160
You think he's got the plague?

01:49.400 --> 01:50.280
Looks like it.

01:51.720 --> 01:53.200
Let's go. Let's get out of here.

01:59.960 --> 02:00.600
(Sir,)

02:01.120 --> 02:02.200
(were we not supposed)

02:02.360 --> 02:04.320
(to travel together to Linchun Town?)

02:05.200 --> 02:06.680
(The epidemic struck
with terrifying force.)

02:06.840 --> 02:07.960
(The bond we shared)

02:08.240 --> 02:10.200
(must end here, I'm afraid.)

02:23.680 --> 02:24.840
Have you really caught the epidemic?

02:25.360 --> 02:26.280
Let me check.

02:26.880 --> 02:28.880
Besides the wound he got because of you,

02:29.880 --> 02:31.200
Mr. Zhao is in perfectly good health.

02:32.600 --> 02:34.080
Did you scheme

02:34.840 --> 02:36.080
to drive them away?

02:36.560 --> 02:38.040
Officials and bandits
have never shared the same fate.

02:38.360 --> 02:39.360
Miss, think carefully.

02:39.920 --> 02:41.040
Are you on the side of the officials,

02:41.760 --> 02:42.520
or the bandits?

02:42.840 --> 02:43.640
Whom will you follow?

02:44.840 --> 02:46.280
But he can help you.

02:46.800 --> 02:47.800
He's an Imperial Envoy.

02:47.800 --> 02:48.720
He wields tremendous authority.

02:48.720 --> 02:49.920
What can he do for me?

02:51.880 --> 02:52.760
Traffic contraband?

02:56.240 --> 02:58.360
Those who hate Jiuweijiao want you dead,

02:58.960 --> 03:00.720
and Jiuweijiao's men seek your life too.

03:00.920 --> 03:02.400
Hunters chase you
across all the Jianghu.

03:02.400 --> 03:03.680
Everyone is out to slay you.

03:04.000 --> 03:05.920
The Imperial Envoy is your lifeline,

03:06.000 --> 03:07.240
yet you push him away.

03:07.880 --> 03:09.480
Why are you so impossibly stubborn,

03:09.480 --> 03:10.480
deaf to all advice?

03:12.040 --> 03:13.600
I stay guarded for good reason.

03:16.320 --> 03:17.800
Once I help you finish this mission,

03:18.600 --> 03:19.600
I will be of no more use to you.

03:21.560 --> 03:23.120
What will you do with me then?

03:23.960 --> 03:25.840
Will you merely
utter a hollow word of thanks,

03:26.160 --> 03:27.120
praising my chivalry?

03:27.720 --> 03:29.720
Or will you stop at nothing,

03:30.240 --> 03:32.520
and hand over all my past misdeeds,

03:33.720 --> 03:34.840
to add another meritorious entry

03:35.480 --> 03:36.280
to your official record?

03:38.360 --> 03:39.000
Fair enough.

03:39.560 --> 03:40.640
All along this journey,

03:41.320 --> 03:42.400
I've never treated you poorly,

03:42.760 --> 03:43.640
nor laid harsh blame on you.

03:45.240 --> 03:46.320
If push comes to shove,

03:46.520 --> 03:47.640
I'll tie you up,

03:48.160 --> 03:49.920
and escort you safely to the capital.

03:49.920 --> 03:52.280
That way you won't want
to go to Linchun Town one day

03:52.440 --> 03:54.000
and Yongning Prefecture the next.

03:55.760 --> 03:56.760
So no extra trouble will arise.

04:01.160 --> 04:01.840
Exactly.

04:02.520 --> 04:03.440
Once you're tied up,

04:04.080 --> 04:05.200
you won't stir up any trouble.

04:05.440 --> 04:06.720
Let go of me!

04:06.920 --> 04:07.680
Let me go.

04:07.880 --> 04:08.480
Be gentle.

04:10.200 --> 04:10.960
Of course,

04:11.120 --> 04:12.960
you could choose to abandon me,

04:13.760 --> 04:14.560
and leave with them.

04:15.520 --> 04:17.200
But think of all the people
we've met along the way,

04:18.560 --> 04:20.440
those ravenous, ruthless refugees,

04:21.120 --> 04:22.640
and that woman who was abandoned.

04:23.480 --> 04:25.360
They all could trick you
out of your food.

04:33.880 --> 04:35.520
I finally found you.

04:36.600 --> 04:37.680
Why are you here?

04:39.680 --> 04:41.160
I've come to repay your kindness.

04:41.640 --> 04:43.080
One must keep one's word.

04:43.520 --> 04:44.680
I told you before,

04:44.840 --> 04:46.880
I would serve you as your maid.

04:47.160 --> 04:48.160
I shall not break that promise.

04:49.160 --> 04:50.360
Wherever you go, miss,

04:50.360 --> 04:51.320
I will follow.

04:52.080 --> 04:53.440
She really came to repay the kindness?

04:55.240 --> 04:56.200
Thank you, miss.

04:56.440 --> 04:57.400
Thanks.

04:57.720 --> 04:58.560
Thanks a lot.

05:06.560 --> 05:08.080
Miss, what are you doing?

05:09.840 --> 05:10.880
We're just having a tiff.

05:12.560 --> 05:13.880
We're out in the middle of nowhere.

05:14.480 --> 05:15.680
If we keep this up,

05:16.760 --> 05:17.640
it'll be dangerous.

05:20.720 --> 05:21.680
Sorry you had to see that mess.

05:23.400 --> 05:24.480
This place isn't safe to linger.

05:25.360 --> 05:25.920
Sen,

05:27.080 --> 05:27.520
let's go.

05:48.760 --> 05:49.320
Mr. Zhao,

05:49.760 --> 05:50.440
we've got a tail.

06:00.040 --> 06:00.680
Mr. Zhao,

06:01.280 --> 06:01.720
it's that man

06:01.720 --> 06:03.440
who fought us at the salt shop.

06:05.920 --> 06:07.360
The second he laid eyes on us,

06:08.120 --> 06:09.760
(Jiu)
He's dead set on getting this token.

06:10.760 --> 06:12.000
He's incredibly persistent.

06:20.880 --> 06:22.723
(Jiu)

06:25.440 --> 06:26.400
I'll lead him away.

06:34.080 --> 06:34.720
Sen.

06:46.440 --> 06:47.040
Let's go.

06:52.920 --> 06:54.120
I can handle this alone.

06:54.280 --> 06:55.120
Stay here.

06:55.240 --> 06:55.920
Keep an eye on them.

06:57.320 --> 06:58.360
Don't let them wander out.

07:12.680 --> 07:13.360
Miss,

07:14.000 --> 07:15.440
please sit down and rest a while.

07:26.920 --> 07:31.240
Cargo fish swish tails
through Dragon Gate;

07:32.120 --> 07:35.920
Eaves mice gnaw cash,
three bite marks remain;

07:36.200 --> 07:39.960
Black bear bears down, scales sink low;

07:41.600 --> 07:44.240
Fox paws shear silver,
split fifty-fifty.

07:45.640 --> 07:46.680
What's this?

07:46.920 --> 07:48.040
The Snow Salt Ballad.

07:49.160 --> 07:50.440
Jiuweijiao's trade code.

07:50.760 --> 07:52.320
You ladies wouldn't understand.

08:03.120 --> 08:03.760
Miss,

08:03.960 --> 08:05.160
let me take you and run away.

08:05.280 --> 08:06.560
I've seen through them long ago.

08:06.680 --> 08:08.040
Those two are human traffickers.

08:08.560 --> 08:10.360
(Jiu)
They say they'll take you there,

08:10.480 --> 08:11.720
but you're such a beautiful young lady.

08:12.040 --> 08:13.920
Who knows where they'll sell you off to.

08:18.806 --> 08:20.880
(The Snow Salt Ballad)

08:24.400 --> 08:25.320
Thank you, miss.

08:25.640 --> 08:26.560
May I know your name?

08:27.880 --> 08:29.680
Just call me Zheng Sanniang.

08:33.080 --> 08:33.880
Sanniang,

08:34.320 --> 08:36.480
would you take me to Linchun Town?

08:36.880 --> 08:38.160
I have a distant relative there,

08:38.240 --> 08:39.120
and I can seek shelter with them.

08:39.280 --> 08:40.560
Of course I'd love to.

09:42.160 --> 09:42.760
That way.

09:55.200 --> 09:55.920
Mr. Zhao.

09:56.480 --> 09:57.160
Mr. Zhao.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.080
Mr. Zhao.

10:00.080 --> 10:00.760
Mr. Zhao.

10:01.080 --> 10:02.120
They knocked me unconscious

10:02.480 --> 10:03.680
and made off with the token.

10:06.640 --> 10:08.200
She's a daughter of an official.

10:08.720 --> 10:09.640
She doesn't deal in salt at all.

10:10.000 --> 10:11.360
What would she even need that token for?

10:21.400 --> 10:22.360
She has no use for it,

10:22.520 --> 10:24.360
but the Imperial Envoy
she's currying favor with does.

10:25.040 --> 10:25.880
Remember,

10:26.280 --> 10:27.440
hidden inside the token

10:28.040 --> 10:29.360
is the Snow Salt Ballad.

10:29.800 --> 10:30.760
Imperial Envoy?

10:31.800 --> 10:32.480
Mr. Zhao,

10:32.600 --> 10:33.880
if the Snow Salt Ballad gets out,

10:34.120 --> 10:35.200
more people

10:35.600 --> 10:36.640
will hunt us down.

10:36.960 --> 10:37.640
We need to flee.

10:41.120 --> 10:43.000
We've wandered Jianghu for years.

10:44.520 --> 10:45.400
How could we get outwitted

10:45.400 --> 10:46.720
by some young lady

10:46.720 --> 10:47.480
who's never left home?

10:50.640 --> 10:51.800
Gather our things.

10:57.240 --> 10:57.960
Let's head

10:58.720 --> 10:59.920
for Linchun Town.

11:00.680 --> 11:03.760
(Linchun Station)

11:04.520 --> 11:06.680
The Sixteenth Master travels incognito
as Imperial Envoy.

11:06.960 --> 11:08.480
Remember to keep this confidential.

11:09.680 --> 11:11.080
I shall keep my lips sealed.

11:11.240 --> 11:13.600
I have ordered the station
to turn away all outsiders.

11:14.280 --> 11:15.440
Please rest assured, sir.

11:17.440 --> 11:18.520
If

11:19.000 --> 11:21.680
there is anything I may assist with,

11:22.040 --> 11:23.640
feel free to let me know.

11:25.360 --> 11:26.520
Your arrangements

11:26.520 --> 11:27.600
are perfectly well thought out.

11:31.240 --> 11:33.560
My son, Jingxiu, is diligent.

11:33.840 --> 11:35.520
Should the Sixteenth Master
need extra hands,

11:35.720 --> 11:36.960
he can be of service.

11:40.040 --> 11:41.240
The autumn provincial exam draws near.

11:41.360 --> 11:42.960
Your son boasts
remarkable talent and knowledge.

11:43.160 --> 11:44.760
A bright future awaits him for sure.

11:44.960 --> 11:46.880
Madam, there is no need to be so hasty.

11:51.280 --> 11:52.640
(Madam Yu?)

11:53.320 --> 11:54.360
(Why is she here?)

11:57.120 --> 11:59.000
Send more men to guard the station.

11:59.160 --> 12:00.880
Keep all outsiders away.

12:05.840 --> 12:07.440
Since I cannot avoid Madam Yu,

12:09.120 --> 12:10.160
I shall use her

12:11.600 --> 12:12.840
as my stepping stone.

12:14.840 --> 12:15.520
Madam,

12:15.600 --> 12:16.920
a young lady asks for an audience.

12:16.920 --> 12:18.120
She claims to be Fu,

12:18.120 --> 12:19.240
the ninth daughter of the Fu family.

12:22.880 --> 12:24.200
Ninth Young Lady Fu?

12:25.960 --> 12:27.120
I thought she was dead.

12:30.080 --> 12:32.360
I thought I would never see you again.

12:34.200 --> 12:35.520
Back when I stayed at Biyun Nunnery,

12:36.440 --> 12:37.280
I was

12:37.800 --> 12:38.800
always thinking of you, Madam.

12:40.640 --> 12:42.120
Fortunately, fate did not forsake me.

12:42.640 --> 12:44.400
I fought my way out
at the cost of my life.

12:45.320 --> 12:46.640
It seems our bond

12:47.120 --> 12:48.160
has not yet run its course.

12:49.560 --> 12:50.440
Back then,

12:51.040 --> 12:52.480
there were some malicious rumors.

12:52.960 --> 12:54.000
I never believed a word of them,

12:55.040 --> 12:56.560
yet I was merely an outsider after all

12:57.120 --> 12:58.320
and could do nothing to help.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.320
Do not misunderstand me, Madam.

13:00.800 --> 13:03.080
I have come uninvited today

13:03.080 --> 13:04.840
not to rekindle our old bond,

13:05.600 --> 13:06.960
but to strike a deal

13:07.360 --> 13:08.600
with you, Madam.

13:09.120 --> 13:11.120
I came across a piece of evidence
on the road.

13:11.400 --> 13:13.680
I thought you might find it interesting.

13:15.320 --> 13:16.600
(The Snow Salt Ballad)
This Snow Salt Ballad

13:16.920 --> 13:19.360
records all parties shared the profits,

13:19.760 --> 13:22.360
and holds pivotal weight
in the salt corruption case.

13:25.200 --> 13:26.880
Something this important...

13:27.960 --> 13:29.400
Where did you get it?

13:30.320 --> 13:31.360
It belongs...

13:31.592 --> 13:32.437
(Jiu)

13:32.480 --> 13:34.080
to the biggest salt smuggler
in the northwest,

13:35.160 --> 13:36.600
Jiuweijiao.

13:45.520 --> 13:47.640
But why is it written as a ballad?

13:47.960 --> 13:49.600
This evidence involves a lot.

13:50.080 --> 13:51.240
If a single word leaks out,

13:51.240 --> 13:52.520
heads will roll.

13:53.440 --> 13:55.200
Jiuweijiao is extremely cautious,

13:55.200 --> 13:56.800
so he encoded everything into a ballad.

13:58.080 --> 13:59.360
But I hold the key

13:59.600 --> 14:00.640
to decode its meaning.

14:01.080 --> 14:02.320
Once I meet the noble lord,

14:02.520 --> 14:03.920
I shall recite the full truth to him.

14:04.520 --> 14:05.760
As my guarantor, Madam,

14:05.920 --> 14:06.720
you will undoubtedly claim

14:06.920 --> 14:08.040
the foremost merit.

14:09.840 --> 14:11.440
If this is a bargain,

14:12.120 --> 14:13.440
what do you seek in return?

14:14.000 --> 14:15.360
Once you take the greatest credit,

14:15.360 --> 14:17.800
I only ask that my name be recorded
for his contribution.

14:20.440 --> 14:21.600
Silly girl,

14:23.200 --> 14:25.040
you shall surely share the merit.

14:26.040 --> 14:27.920
You've traveled so far to find me,

14:28.080 --> 14:30.120
and I'll hold you dear in my heart.

14:30.920 --> 14:32.400
Settle here in peace.

14:32.560 --> 14:33.920
Once the time is right,

14:34.040 --> 14:35.320
I will present you to the noble lord.

14:46.840 --> 14:48.680
It's like receiving a pillow
right when drowsiness hits.

14:48.960 --> 14:52.200
Who would've thought Miss Fu
would stumble upon such fortune?

14:52.200 --> 14:53.400
But I still feel

14:54.080 --> 14:55.520
uneasy.

14:55.720 --> 14:56.640
Indeed.

14:57.280 --> 14:59.040
Back when we were at Huaying,

14:59.160 --> 15:00.600
you did not save her, Madam.

15:01.040 --> 15:02.480
Anyone in that place

15:02.800 --> 15:04.320
would bear a grudge.

15:04.800 --> 15:06.560
It is not about what happened
in the past.

15:07.800 --> 15:09.320
I fear what lies ahead.

15:11.320 --> 15:12.960
After all, she is still an outsider.

15:13.520 --> 15:14.760
There will always be a rift between us.

15:15.920 --> 15:17.440
I must find a way

15:18.080 --> 15:20.040
to bind her fate with ours.

15:22.920 --> 15:23.560
Madam,

15:23.800 --> 15:24.960
another person seeks an audience.

15:24.960 --> 15:26.200
Calm down.

15:26.440 --> 15:27.400
Why so flustered?

15:27.400 --> 15:28.920
This is not your first day serving here.

15:29.240 --> 15:30.360
Did you see a jinx?

15:30.360 --> 15:31.520
He's forced his way in.

15:31.640 --> 15:32.680
He goes by the name Zhao Ling.

15:32.960 --> 15:33.800
Zhao Ling?

15:34.880 --> 15:36.040
He is truly a jinx.

15:36.880 --> 15:38.120
It's a matter of great importance.

15:39.080 --> 15:41.440
We cannot let this ill-omened fellow
ruin our plans.

15:43.040 --> 15:44.280
Where is Fu Tingyun?

15:58.200 --> 15:58.960
Zhao Ling.

16:04.080 --> 16:05.120
You've got quite the nerve.

16:05.960 --> 16:07.680
Do you think
this is the Fu family in Huaying?

16:07.680 --> 16:08.880
How dare you run wild here.

16:09.720 --> 16:11.040
I have no intention of fighting.

16:12.840 --> 16:14.280
Give me the token and the man,

16:14.440 --> 16:15.320
and I'll walk away right now.

16:16.600 --> 16:17.840
And if I say no?

16:20.840 --> 16:21.840
Then I guess

16:24.080 --> 16:25.880
we do this the hard way.

16:26.520 --> 16:27.560
You're a bold one,

16:27.960 --> 16:29.960
but you can't win this fight alone.

16:40.520 --> 16:41.280
Madam Yu.

16:41.640 --> 16:43.360
He is the leader
of the Western Capital salt bandits,

16:43.360 --> 16:44.280
Jiuweijiao.

16:45.280 --> 16:47.440
You're actually Jiuweijiao?

16:50.600 --> 16:51.000
I...

16:53.680 --> 16:55.200
I have an epidemic upon me.

16:55.320 --> 16:56.560
Stay away from me, all of you.

16:59.440 --> 17:00.000
Don't run!

17:09.200 --> 17:11.080
You rascal, you lied to me.

17:15.080 --> 17:16.280
Xiuchun Blade?

17:18.200 --> 17:19.560
The Imperial Guards?

17:44.320 --> 17:46.080
(I planned to find him
once this matter was settled,)

17:46.440 --> 17:47.880
(yet he forced his way in uninvited.)

17:48.640 --> 17:50.200
Jiuweijiao has a notorious reputation.

17:50.480 --> 17:52.040
The Sixteenth Master
holds an exalted status.

17:52.120 --> 17:53.520
We cannot afford the slightest mishap.

17:54.120 --> 17:56.160
We must silence him
without delay to be safe.

18:08.480 --> 18:10.360
Have you forgotten
how many men I have at my back?

18:13.320 --> 18:15.480
If any harm befalls me today,

18:16.400 --> 18:18.400
none of you will escape unscathed.

18:22.080 --> 18:22.840
Come to think of it,

18:23.480 --> 18:25.520
you've got a point there.

18:26.360 --> 18:27.040
Right,

18:27.520 --> 18:30.280
killing one is far less satisfying
than wiping out the whole gang.

18:31.840 --> 18:33.160
Lock him up for now.

18:37.280 --> 18:37.920
Take him away.

18:38.080 --> 18:38.520
Yes, sir.

18:39.680 --> 18:40.200
Take him away.

18:41.120 --> 18:41.560
Go.

18:43.480 --> 18:44.040
No.

18:45.000 --> 18:46.560
I must see the noble lord at once.

18:50.720 --> 18:51.760
Tell me,

18:52.280 --> 18:53.440
where are your men?

18:53.920 --> 18:55.920
If I tell you where they are,

18:59.360 --> 19:00.720
will you set me free?

19:09.640 --> 19:10.600
Jiuweijiao,

19:11.440 --> 19:13.280
don't try to trick me.

19:13.520 --> 19:15.440
You're in no position to bargain.

19:15.520 --> 19:16.000
Tell me!

19:19.200 --> 19:20.040
I'll talk.

19:20.760 --> 19:22.040
My men

19:23.400 --> 19:24.560
are hot on my trail.

19:26.000 --> 19:27.240
If I'm not wrong,

19:27.320 --> 19:29.000
they're already on their way
to rescue me.

19:29.600 --> 19:30.480
They're only

19:32.480 --> 19:33.920
a short distance away.

19:34.280 --> 19:35.840
You can't miss Sen.

19:37.960 --> 19:39.120
He's

19:42.440 --> 19:44.360
in his mid-thirties.

19:48.200 --> 19:48.760
Mr. Feng,

19:48.960 --> 19:50.680
Zhao Ling's gang must be nearby.

19:51.400 --> 19:51.920
Search.

19:52.080 --> 19:53.480
He bears a blade scar on his left cheek.

19:53.920 --> 19:55.080
Four moles mark his right cheek.

19:55.440 --> 19:56.720
They're extremely tough foes.

19:56.840 --> 19:58.200
Armed with plenty of weapons.

19:58.320 --> 19:58.720
Let's go.

19:59.240 --> 20:00.720
You'd better take more men with you.

20:01.640 --> 20:04.160
How do I know you're telling the truth?

20:04.160 --> 20:05.880
I have survived the Jianghu,

20:07.320 --> 20:09.120
all thanks to the Snow Salt Ballad.

20:09.520 --> 20:10.800
I'll tell you the first four lines.

20:13.000 --> 20:14.320
If they can match them,

20:14.880 --> 20:16.440
they're surely my men.

20:19.600 --> 20:21.000
When will you introduce me

20:21.400 --> 20:22.320
to the noble lord?

20:24.320 --> 20:25.160
Don't rush.

20:25.720 --> 20:26.920
I will introduce you,

20:27.880 --> 20:29.480
but first I'll secure you
a proper station.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.720
I wish to lend you a hand.

20:34.000 --> 20:35.560
Such a lovely magnolia

20:35.560 --> 20:36.840
faded to mud.

20:37.440 --> 20:38.760
What a pity it is.

20:39.080 --> 20:40.440
How can I bear to see it?

20:41.360 --> 20:42.360
Why not

20:42.760 --> 20:44.120
become Jingxiu's concubine?

20:44.320 --> 20:45.760
We could pick up our old bond again.

20:46.320 --> 20:47.880
All the wealth and glory you once knew,

20:47.880 --> 20:49.640
fine silks and delicacies
shall remain yours.

20:51.320 --> 20:53.720
You'll once more
be that radiant noble lady.

20:55.560 --> 20:57.240
Why are you humiliating me like this?

20:57.640 --> 20:59.160
I hold you in high regard,

20:59.160 --> 21:00.560
so I plan this path for you.

21:02.960 --> 21:04.520
Aren't you craving merit?

21:05.560 --> 21:07.080
If we stand united
as mother-in-law and daughter-in-law,

21:07.360 --> 21:09.720
we can seize all these immense rewards.

21:10.400 --> 21:11.560
Wouldn't that be perfect?

21:12.880 --> 21:15.320
You just don't want benefits
falling into outsiders' hands, Madam.

21:16.120 --> 21:17.440
With this bond between us,

21:17.680 --> 21:18.520
later on,

21:19.520 --> 21:20.880
you'll have me firmly under your thumb.

21:23.640 --> 21:25.160
I've checked the almanac.

21:25.640 --> 21:27.240
Today is an auspicious day for weddings.

21:27.600 --> 21:28.440
Why not

21:29.000 --> 21:31.000
settle the matter tonight?

21:31.520 --> 21:32.440
Tomorrow at dawn,

21:33.240 --> 21:35.240
I'll take you to meet the noble lord.

21:46.360 --> 21:47.360
As you know,

21:47.520 --> 21:49.280
our family has few heirs.

21:50.040 --> 21:51.680
Jingxiu carries on both branches.

21:52.080 --> 21:53.520
Any children you bear later

21:54.000 --> 21:55.640
will have to be adopted
by the main branch.

21:56.360 --> 21:58.120
What exactly do you mean, Madam?

21:58.320 --> 22:00.840
I've picked a maiden for you recently.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.920
With her by your side,

22:03.200 --> 22:05.520
she can share the burden
of bearing heirs.

22:05.920 --> 22:07.600
You may set your mind at ease.

22:08.760 --> 22:10.000
You've thought of everything, Madam.

22:10.600 --> 22:12.760
But there's no rush for this.

22:13.280 --> 22:14.880
We can talk it over another time.

22:15.200 --> 22:16.080
Listen to me.

22:16.960 --> 22:18.320
Let Jingxiu take her as his concubine.

22:20.680 --> 22:22.120
His studies exhaust him.

22:23.000 --> 22:24.920
She may accompany him on the road.

22:26.280 --> 22:27.320
Could it be

22:28.080 --> 22:29.400
you cannot bear her presence?

22:30.320 --> 22:31.240
Of course not.

22:32.120 --> 22:33.320
It's just that

22:33.720 --> 22:35.160
along this journey,

22:35.320 --> 22:36.920
I've seen no clever maidens.

22:37.400 --> 22:38.800
I wonder who's blessed enough

22:39.120 --> 22:40.480
to win your favor, Madam.

22:41.400 --> 22:42.720
She is no ordinary maiden.

22:44.080 --> 22:45.600
You know her too.

22:45.720 --> 22:47.440
The Magnolia from the Huaying.

22:48.960 --> 22:49.800
Tingyun?

22:51.280 --> 22:52.520
Wasn't she dead?

22:53.000 --> 22:54.120
Not only was she alive,

22:54.400 --> 22:55.680
but she came to seek refuge with me.

22:56.240 --> 22:57.920
Seeing her all alone and destitute,

22:58.200 --> 22:59.760
I wished to grant her a way to survive.

23:00.120 --> 23:01.320
The contract bears witness.

23:01.320 --> 23:02.720
She's Zuo Junjie's wife.

23:03.640 --> 23:04.520
Look at you,

23:05.280 --> 23:06.680
still sulking, aren't you?

23:08.120 --> 23:10.400
I want you to set your mind at ease.

23:11.320 --> 23:13.360
That's why I leave this to you.

23:14.760 --> 23:16.360
The Yu family upholds strict rules.

23:17.120 --> 23:18.360
Wives outrank concubines.

23:18.960 --> 23:20.000
What have you to fear?

23:24.520 --> 23:25.360
Tonight,

23:25.640 --> 23:28.400
take this wine to Jingxiu's chambers.

23:33.680 --> 23:34.680
Miss Fan,

23:35.280 --> 23:36.840
the Yu family has strict rules.

23:37.000 --> 23:38.600
A mother-in-law
always outranks a daughter-in-law.

23:39.120 --> 23:41.200
You must obey the Madam in all things.

23:41.800 --> 23:43.120
Last time, the Madam

23:43.120 --> 23:45.480
only wished to borrow
a chest of manuscripts from you.

23:45.680 --> 23:47.120
Such a trivial matter,

23:47.360 --> 23:48.720
yet you failed to see it done.

24:05.080 --> 24:05.840
Mr. Zhao.

24:06.640 --> 24:07.280
Mr. Zhao.

24:08.320 --> 24:09.440
You've truly fallen under their thumb.

24:09.960 --> 24:11.120
See? You can't do without me.

24:11.400 --> 24:12.320
I've fetched Chuan

24:12.320 --> 24:13.720
and Biao and the others.

24:16.720 --> 24:18.720
I thought you headed for the capital?

24:18.880 --> 24:20.080
How'd you get stuck here?

24:20.680 --> 24:22.080
Luckily we weren't far off.

24:22.080 --> 24:22.600
Otherwise,

24:22.720 --> 24:23.800
you two would've died here.

24:29.600 --> 24:30.360
Chuan and Biao,

24:30.880 --> 24:31.800
you take the men

24:31.800 --> 24:32.760
and wait outside first.

24:33.240 --> 24:34.160
Sen, come with me.

24:34.840 --> 24:36.080
I'd like to see

24:37.680 --> 24:38.800
what tricks the Ninth Young Lady

24:38.800 --> 24:40.280
is really playing.

24:40.800 --> 24:41.520
Mr. Zhao,

24:42.280 --> 24:43.320
the guards here

24:43.960 --> 24:45.520
are not as tough as you said.

24:46.560 --> 24:48.360
I sent half the guards away.

24:48.840 --> 24:49.840
How?

24:49.920 --> 24:51.720
The Snow Salt Ballad has sixteen lines,
right?

24:53.360 --> 24:54.760
As for its first four lines,

24:56.440 --> 24:58.640
every salt gang member knows them well.

25:01.200 --> 25:01.800
Who's there?

25:06.440 --> 25:08.880
Cargo fish swish tails
through Dragon Gate.

25:10.520 --> 25:12.320
Eaves mice gnaw cash,
three bite marks remain.

25:13.520 --> 25:14.600
Good, you've arrived.

25:15.520 --> 25:16.840
We've all been waiting.

25:17.360 --> 25:18.040
Where's Zhao Ling?

25:24.280 --> 25:25.760
How dare you possess restricted weapons?

25:26.040 --> 25:26.880
Listen up.

25:27.440 --> 25:29.920
Jiuweijiao sold all of you to me.

25:30.480 --> 25:31.600
Seize them all.

25:37.070 --> 25:39.523
(Qixia Chamber)

25:46.240 --> 25:47.000
Tingyun,

25:52.520 --> 25:53.480
I never imagined

25:54.440 --> 25:56.280
we'd meet again
under such circumstances.

25:57.040 --> 25:58.120
For a moment,

25:59.360 --> 26:00.960
I'm not sure whether to address you
as Miss Fu

26:01.960 --> 26:03.160
or Miss Xie.

26:11.360 --> 26:12.360
I know

26:13.400 --> 26:14.320
you resent me,

26:15.040 --> 26:16.200
but what could I do?

26:16.920 --> 26:18.040
After tonight,

26:18.560 --> 26:20.080
we'll be living side by side again.

26:21.600 --> 26:23.000
Mr. Yu favors plain, subtle styles.

26:23.960 --> 26:25.520
I've specially picked out fabrics

26:25.800 --> 26:27.480
with patterns to his liking for you.

26:27.880 --> 26:29.680
Aren't these the fabrics
you used to wear?

26:31.280 --> 26:32.560
These are the bolts

26:32.920 --> 26:34.920
we picked out together back then.

26:35.840 --> 26:37.120
I gave them all to you.

26:38.240 --> 26:39.360
Now I hand them back to you.

26:40.680 --> 26:41.560
Isn't this perfect for you?

26:43.080 --> 26:44.640
Strange indeed.

26:45.720 --> 26:47.880
What did you do to anger her so?

26:48.800 --> 26:51.480
That she'd plant me right beside you

26:51.720 --> 26:53.680
to make sure you never live in peace.

26:55.440 --> 26:56.800
Peace? It's not about peace.

26:57.080 --> 26:58.280
It's just taking a concubine.

26:58.480 --> 27:00.320
Miss Fan will always be the main wife.

27:03.360 --> 27:05.160
But there might be a way

27:07.160 --> 27:08.680
to spare me from becoming a concubine.

27:11.040 --> 27:12.280
Spare you from being a concubine?

27:14.840 --> 27:16.000
There's an honored guest

27:16.800 --> 27:18.320
staying in your east courtyard, right?

27:18.800 --> 27:20.480
He seems to carry
an even loftier station.

27:21.720 --> 27:23.320
His entourage
consists of men traveling afar

27:24.120 --> 27:26.120
and they lack a gentle lady

27:26.120 --> 27:28.240
to ease their weariness
and lighten their cares.

27:30.800 --> 27:32.160
This is my chance.

27:33.560 --> 27:34.960
I doubt you'll ever gain access

27:35.840 --> 27:36.880
to that noble lord.

27:37.000 --> 27:38.400
That's right.

27:40.280 --> 27:42.280
But you have the Yu family backing you.

27:43.120 --> 27:44.440
Surely you could lead me there.

27:54.240 --> 27:55.880
Madam Yu sends maids

27:55.880 --> 27:56.840
to wait on the noble guest's baths
every single day.

27:57.280 --> 27:58.800
Miss Fan slipped some silver
to arrange it.

27:59.080 --> 28:00.120
You're the one going tonight.

28:00.520 --> 28:01.800
It's infuriating

28:01.960 --> 28:03.120
she has to suffer the consequences
of your deeds.

28:03.440 --> 28:04.240
Don't worry.

28:05.240 --> 28:07.040
She is far too clever.

28:07.480 --> 28:09.960
She will find a way
to clear her own name.

28:14.960 --> 28:15.560
Your Highness,

28:15.840 --> 28:16.920
news has come from the city.

28:17.720 --> 28:19.000
All our men

28:19.840 --> 28:21.080
have been slain.

28:22.080 --> 28:23.160
How corrupt he is.

28:23.560 --> 28:25.360
How dare they flaunt
such reckless audacity.

28:27.880 --> 28:29.680
Yongning Prefecture is the seat
of government after all.

28:29.960 --> 28:31.080
Its officials are all in cahoots,

28:31.080 --> 28:31.920
leaving no gaps for infiltration.

28:32.320 --> 28:33.880
We must find a fresh recruit

28:34.040 --> 28:35.280
who's trustworthy and unknown locally

28:35.360 --> 28:36.440
to act as our informant

28:36.440 --> 28:37.600
and help us gather evidence.

28:37.680 --> 28:38.920
A total stranger with no ties here.

28:39.480 --> 28:41.920
Also need courage, wit, and integrity,

28:42.200 --> 28:43.440
and earn our complete trust.

28:43.960 --> 28:45.720
Where can we find such a person?

28:54.360 --> 28:55.000
-Halt!
-Halt!

28:58.160 --> 28:59.120
We've come to bring the noble lord

28:59.120 --> 29:00.200
foot-washing water.

29:00.680 --> 29:01.680
It's you.

29:02.200 --> 29:02.720
You...

29:03.080 --> 29:04.480
How did you find your way here?

29:04.720 --> 29:06.440
I have matters to
discuss with my benefactor in person.

29:07.000 --> 29:08.520
I beg you, sir, to pass word to him.

29:09.280 --> 29:09.920
Miss,

29:10.120 --> 29:11.000
if you have business,

29:11.080 --> 29:11.920
come back tomorrow.

29:12.240 --> 29:13.200
It's late at night.

29:13.520 --> 29:14.200
Leave at once.

29:14.680 --> 29:15.200
Shut the gate.

29:27.040 --> 29:27.440
You!

29:28.000 --> 29:28.520
Stop right there.

29:28.520 --> 29:29.200
What are you doing?

29:32.400 --> 29:33.000
Miss,

29:33.800 --> 29:35.040
it's not too late to turn back now

29:35.120 --> 29:35.960
and mend your ways.

29:36.240 --> 29:37.520
Do not commit an irreversible mistake.

29:42.880 --> 29:44.600
Cargo fish swish tails
through Dragon Gate;

29:44.880 --> 29:46.640
Eaves mice gnaw cash,
three bite marks remain;

29:46.640 --> 29:48.440
Black bear bears down,
scales sink low;

29:48.680 --> 29:50.400
Fox paws shear silver,
split fifty-fifty.

29:50.560 --> 29:51.200
Take her away.

29:52.600 --> 29:54.240
West winds carry salt
across dry plateaus far;

29:54.360 --> 29:56.040
Nine winding gullies twist
around East Gate's scar;

29:56.040 --> 29:57.480
Seek the secret trails
where contraband salt marches;

29:57.800 --> 29:59.920
Three lines within the frame,
moon creeps above the arch.

30:00.320 --> 30:01.080
Hold on.

30:02.120 --> 30:03.720
What is being chanted outside?

30:03.720 --> 30:04.680
The Snow Salt Ballad.

30:05.040 --> 30:06.200
Within Western Capital's borders,

30:06.200 --> 30:08.160
it lays bare all corrupt dealings
between officials and merchants.

30:08.560 --> 30:11.240
My fiance is Jiuweijiao,
a salt merchant of Western Capital.

30:11.320 --> 30:12.600
He taught me this ballad.

30:13.080 --> 30:14.840
Though Mr. Zhao
traffics in contraband salt,

30:15.160 --> 30:16.560
in Huaying County,

30:16.680 --> 30:18.400
he dissolved a hundred thousand
catties of salt and distributed it

30:18.400 --> 30:19.320
among the common folk.

30:19.920 --> 30:21.280
He knows right from wrong,

30:21.280 --> 30:22.920
a gallant man of sound judgment.

30:23.280 --> 30:25.200
The Imperial Envoy aims to clean up
Western Capital's salt administration.

30:25.800 --> 30:26.480
Wait.

30:31.200 --> 30:33.240
This is his perfect chance
to forsake darkness for justice.

30:34.040 --> 30:35.200
I'm begging you.

30:35.520 --> 30:36.760
Please spare his life.

30:37.080 --> 30:39.560
My husband and I shall serve you
with utter devotion,

30:39.560 --> 30:40.640
atone for his crimes
with meritorious deeds.

30:45.400 --> 30:47.280
Have you seen the roads lined
with starving corpses

30:48.480 --> 30:49.840
along your journey?

30:50.560 --> 30:51.680
Mr. Zhao is branded an outlaw,

30:52.120 --> 30:53.600
yet he is a good man at heart.

30:53.880 --> 30:55.440
If those who yearn
to walk the righteous path

30:55.440 --> 30:56.360
are left with no way to survive,

30:56.840 --> 30:58.520
no matter how many cases
you investigate,

30:58.840 --> 31:00.800
the common people will still starve

31:00.880 --> 31:01.920
and shiver in tattered rags.

31:02.160 --> 31:05.240
Good men will keep
being driven to banditry.

31:06.800 --> 31:07.760
Please, calm your anger.

31:10.600 --> 31:11.800
This is my fault
for mismanaging my household.

31:12.280 --> 31:14.440
Some reckless maid
turned up out of nowhere

31:14.440 --> 31:15.720
and disturbed your peace.

31:15.720 --> 31:16.160
Take her away.

31:18.520 --> 31:21.280
I beg for an audience!

31:24.760 --> 31:25.840
(Sixteenth Master)
Do not give her a hard time.

31:35.600 --> 31:37.200
Greetings, Your Highness.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.120
It is you.

31:40.920 --> 31:42.280
Back at Puji Temple that day,

31:42.280 --> 31:43.840
I saw you had remarkable wit,

31:43.840 --> 31:44.920
sharp and quick-minded.

31:45.120 --> 31:46.080
Come inside with me.

31:46.400 --> 31:47.720
Recite that ballad you sang earlier

31:47.920 --> 31:48.880
once more.

32:10.480 --> 32:11.080
Madam.

32:11.200 --> 32:11.880
Madam.

32:13.720 --> 32:16.240
Fu Tingyun has quite the nerve.

32:18.440 --> 32:19.080
Madam.

32:20.440 --> 32:21.440
What if

32:21.440 --> 32:22.520
we run away first?

32:23.360 --> 32:24.280
Let me think for a moment.

32:25.560 --> 32:26.640
You've got quite a lot of courage.

32:27.160 --> 32:28.400
What makes you think

32:28.760 --> 32:30.200
I'd spare you a chance?

32:34.000 --> 32:34.920
I wager

32:35.760 --> 32:36.880
you are an upright official.

32:37.400 --> 32:39.040
Surely you seek to root out

32:39.200 --> 32:41.080
those corrupt boat fish and eaves mice,

32:41.240 --> 32:42.280
black bears and foxes

32:42.360 --> 32:43.560
to purge the Nine Ravines,

32:44.160 --> 32:45.520
rather than hunt down

32:45.520 --> 32:47.000
a helpless little mouse, a salt smuggler

32:47.160 --> 32:48.080
with nowhere to turn.

32:50.720 --> 32:52.160
We are in urgent need of informants.

32:52.360 --> 32:53.640
You're bold and resourceful,

32:53.800 --> 32:55.320
and your fiance knows
all the salt routes.

32:55.320 --> 32:57.120
You would be perfect for the job.

32:58.080 --> 32:58.840
I wonder

32:59.400 --> 33:01.960
if you can speak for Jiuweijiao.

33:03.880 --> 33:05.080
I will surely persuade him.

33:14.640 --> 33:16.320
(Though Mr. Zhao
traffics contraband salt,)

33:16.680 --> 33:18.040
(in Huaying County,)

33:18.200 --> 33:19.920
(he dissolved a hundred thousand
catties of salt and distributed it)

33:19.920 --> 33:20.880
(among the common folk.)

33:21.440 --> 33:22.760
(He knows right from wrong,)

33:22.760 --> 33:24.440
(a gallant man of sound judgment.)

33:24.960 --> 33:26.520
(If those who yearn
to walk the righteous path)

33:26.520 --> 33:27.440
(are left with no way to survive,)

33:27.920 --> 33:29.600
(no matter how many cases
you investigate,)

33:29.920 --> 33:31.880
(the common people will still starve,)

33:31.960 --> 33:33.000
(and shiver in tattered rags.)

33:53.800 --> 33:55.520
Ninth Young Lady, you came
bearing a blade.

34:00.600 --> 34:01.840
Is there something you wish to say?

34:02.160 --> 34:03.800
I knew you'd come walking to your grave,

34:04.760 --> 34:06.280
so I've come to spare your life.

34:06.880 --> 34:08.600
Do I not owe this wretched state

34:11.360 --> 34:13.200
entirely to your doing,
Ninth Young Lady?

34:15.080 --> 34:16.280
If I so desired,

34:17.480 --> 34:19.160
I could end your life right here.

34:21.160 --> 34:23.880
Mr. Zhao, you have yet
to grasp the current tide of affairs,

34:24.560 --> 34:26.160
so I shall spell it out once more.

34:26.960 --> 34:27.720
You

34:28.440 --> 34:29.560
have two choices: follow me,

34:29.920 --> 34:31.680
aid the Imperial Envoy to solve crimes
and earn merit,

34:31.920 --> 34:32.560
or

34:33.760 --> 34:35.400
face certain death.

34:35.640 --> 34:37.120
I can grant you that end this instant.

34:40.000 --> 34:40.920
Ninth Young Lady,

34:42.280 --> 34:43.880
you've picked the wrong foe
to vent your rage on,

34:44.480 --> 34:45.560
taking it all out on me, have you not?

34:48.880 --> 34:50.640
Save your glib words for someone else.

34:51.600 --> 34:52.840
You yearn to walk the righteous path,

34:53.240 --> 34:55.280
sick of a world
where power crushes the weak.

34:55.880 --> 34:57.640
But empty brute force

34:57.640 --> 34:59.400
will only leave you
at the mercy of tyrants,

34:59.880 --> 35:02.320
dragging you deeper into the mire.

35:03.120 --> 35:04.120
As you said yourself,

35:04.320 --> 35:05.960
they're all cut from the same cloth.

35:07.520 --> 35:08.360
But mark my words,

35:09.760 --> 35:12.920
the Envoy is unlike any official
you've known.

35:16.520 --> 35:18.360
He is the Crown Prince of the realm.

35:25.200 --> 35:25.840
The Crown

35:30.320 --> 35:31.160
Prince?

35:38.880 --> 35:40.760
No wonder there are Imperial Guards
and hand cannons.

35:47.560 --> 35:48.400
This game is beyond me.

35:49.760 --> 35:50.480
I take my leave.

35:51.360 --> 35:52.320
Zhao Ling, wait!

35:54.160 --> 35:55.520
Can you truly resign yourself

35:55.680 --> 35:57.960
to being a pawn
on their gambling table forever?

35:59.120 --> 36:01.240
Pretending to be Jiuweijiao
is no great feat.

36:02.440 --> 36:03.440
With your talent,

36:03.440 --> 36:04.400
you could hold the game's reins,

36:04.400 --> 36:05.240
place your own bets,

36:05.240 --> 36:06.640
and achieve more than he ever could.

36:07.600 --> 36:09.080
Ninth Young Lady,
you're full of schemes,

36:09.080 --> 36:10.480
fully capable of handling
all this alone.

36:10.880 --> 36:12.520
Why drag me into this mess?

36:17.600 --> 36:18.680
Unmarried women

36:19.000 --> 36:20.840
can't navigate official social circles.

36:21.960 --> 36:23.280
I need a man by my side.

36:30.570 --> 36:33.120
(Next Episode)

36:34.120 --> 36:35.000
You possess loyal courage,

36:35.080 --> 36:36.440
and Miss Xie is full of stratagems.

36:37.000 --> 36:38.400
If this case is solved,

36:38.680 --> 36:40.360
I shall bestow great rewards.

36:41.920 --> 36:43.960
I wish to take over
Jiuweijiao's enterprises.

36:44.720 --> 36:45.840
You are his most trusted subordinate.

36:46.320 --> 36:47.080
No one but you

36:48.000 --> 36:48.920
can help me.

36:49.120 --> 36:51.000
I utterly detest the Ninth Young Lady,

36:51.000 --> 36:52.080
as you well know.

36:52.160 --> 36:53.520
Why must you choose her

36:53.520 --> 36:55.080
to stand before me and irk my eyes?

36:55.200 --> 36:56.920
Do you loathe her,
or loathe my decision?

36:57.240 --> 36:58.840
If you wish to sit at my table,

36:59.680 --> 37:00.720
either obey my will,

37:01.200 --> 37:01.920
or

37:02.840 --> 37:03.800
take your leave.

37:15.601 --> 37:19.921
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

37:23.521 --> 37:27.881
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

37:30.001 --> 37:34.641
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

37:34.881 --> 37:37.681
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

37:38.841 --> 37:43.481
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

37:46.681 --> 37:53.521
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

37:54.401 --> 38:00.921
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

38:01.881 --> 38:05.321
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

38:05.841 --> 38:10.041
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

38:10.321 --> 38:16.001
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

38:28.121 --> 38:32.001
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

38:35.921 --> 38:39.921
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

38:41.641 --> 38:46.321
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

38:46.641 --> 38:49.321
♪Kept close within my heart♪

38:50.401 --> 38:55.241
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

38:58.761 --> 39:05.681
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

39:06.561 --> 39:13.041
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

39:13.921 --> 39:17.441
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

39:17.881 --> 39:22.241
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

39:22.441 --> 39:28.161
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
